        "title": "Page 2",
        "meta_descr": "Aisling Fegan (she / her) is a HCPC registered art psychotherapist. Based in Newark-on-Trent, she offers group analytic art therapy locally and online | climate crisis | social action art therapy | art psychotherapy  |  group analysis  | social justice  |  community | artist collective | community-led | grassroots | artist-led | neurodivergent  | LGBTQ+ |  lived experienced  |  anti-oppression  | ANTI-COLONIAL | low cost therapy  |  British Association of Art Therapy  | Depression  |  Burnout  | Anxiety  | Irish Artist  | Product Design  | Design for Film & Theatre  |  Newark-on-Trent  | Nottingham London  | Dublin  | Wicklow  | Kells, Co. Meath  | Meath Galway  | Swiss Cottage  | Croydon  | Clapham  | North Kensington  | Bray Co. Wicklow  | Group Analysis India |",
        "header_custom": "",
        "footer_custom": "",
